#, python-format
msgid "Want to say thanks to *%(recipient)s* for this submission? Give them a month of [tippr gold](/gold/about)."
msgstr "Vill du tacka *%(recipient)s* för det här bidraget? Ge dem en månads [tippr guld](/gold/about)."

